{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657570/extras/fffff6f2d4079e0329162e6d0ea9ca97.avif?t=1772792073\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Catching is a childhood game of catching that takes place in a building with multiple levels. In this game you will be playing with friends, and one of them will be chosen as a catcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a group of friends (Mininum of 2 players, Maximum of 4)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One of them will be chosen as the 'Catcher'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Run, Hide, Scream and take the elevator...do not get caught. Do everything to survive the game of Block Catching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657570/extras/db1c307b743bc706fa5821380eb56405.poster.avif?t=1772792073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657570/extras/db1c307b743bc706fa5821380eb56405.webm?t=1772792073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657570/extras/db1c307b743bc706fa5821380eb56405.mp4?t=1772792073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657570/extras/96f655ed516f78e176d91fd2cf0fce2f.avif?t=1772792073\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen, react, and outsmart your opponents in a sound-driven horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_